==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/dɪˈvɪzɪbɪlɪti/|a=UK}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Flame, not lame-divisibility.wav|a=US}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|uncountable}} The state of being [[divisible]]. The state capable of being [[divide]]d.
# {{lb|en|arithmetic}} The property of being divisible by a particular [[integer]].

====Antonyms====
* {{l|en|combinability}}（state capable of being combined）
* {{l|en|mergeability}}（state capable of being merged）
* {{l|en|indivisibility}}（state incapable of being divided）

